{"about_the_game":"Enjoy the joyfully bouncy Original Bamerang Soundtrack by Lucien Guy Montandon!<br><br>Check out Bamerang the game!<br><br><br><br>&quot;Finding the aesthetics for the Bamerang soundtrack was a challenging and enjoyable experience. I imagined those characters making music at the end of a long fight. How would their music sound and what kind of instruments do they play? There is a bit of an organic-esoteric influence, which stands for the culture of the characters. <br>And there is the world, which is very colourful, and that brought the pop in. I think those were the main keyframes during the production and composing process. <br>I hope it will fit for the listeners when they play the game or when they are listening to the soundtrack.&quot;<br>- Lucien Guy Montandon<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562280/extras/981adc9662fb9a165d9e47c989e36ab9.poster.avif?t=1626703456\" width=594 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562280/extras/981adc9662fb9a165d9e47c989e36ab9.webm?t=1626703456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1562280?t=1626703456","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1562280?t=1626703456","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562280/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1626703456","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562280/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1626703456","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Enjoy the joyfully bouncy Original Bamerang Soundtrack by Lucien Guy Montandon!<br><br>Check out Bameran